		{"id":"2a2df678032d5679","x":1392,"y":930,"width":396,"height":80,"type":"text","text":"## 9.15（绝对值+奇偶性）\n![](../../../../../assets/image/01积分概+计-1770902432860.jpeg)![](../../../../../assets/image/01积分概+计-1770902454795.jpeg)\n\n## 9.17（绝对值）\n![](../../../../../assets/image/01积分概+计-1770903554735.jpeg)\n一定注意，去根号时，是|x|!!!！\n"},
